    "Be mindful of obstacles and evade them to keep playing.",
    "Savor the cute graphics and lovable characters that animate the game.",
    "Discover the distinctive 2D action format of this rhythm adventure.",
    "Allow your enthusiasm, bravery, and affection for charming characters to lead you to success."
